sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Buyer
    participant Web as apps/web
    participant API as payments.routes
    participant GW as gateways/paynet
    participant App as Paynet app
    participant UWS as paynet.routes (/uws)
    participant Svc as paynet.service
    participant Pay as payments.service
    participant DB as Postgres

    Buyer->>Web: choose Paynet at checkout
    Web->>API: POST /payments/intents {order_id, provider=paynet}
    API->>GW: create_intent(order)
    GW-->>API: deep link with order_id + amount in tiyin
    API->>DB: INSERT payments (pending)
    API-->>Web: 201 PaymentOut
    Web-->>Buyer: open the link
    Buyer->>App: confirm — nothing is typed

    App->>UWS: GetInformation (Basic auth)
    Note over UWS: no or wrong credentials — HTTP 401, no body
    UWS->>Svc: is this order payable, and for how much
    Svc->>DB: SELECT orders
    Svc-->>UWS: status 0, amount in tiyin
    UWS-->>App: 200 result

    App->>UWS: PerformTransaction {transactionId, amount, fields.order_id}
    UWS->>Svc: settle
    alt this transactionId was already performed
        Svc-->>UWS: echo the stored row — no second charge
    else amount does not match the order
        Svc-->>UWS: error 413
    else
        Svc->>DB: INSERT paynet_transactions (state 1, providerTrnId from sequence)
        Svc->>Pay: settle_provider_payment
        Pay->>DB: payment succeeded, order paid, fulfilment queued
        Svc-->>UWS: providerTrnId, timestamp
    end
    UWS-->>App: 200 result
    App-->>Buyer: paid

    opt reversal, initiated on Paynet's side
        App->>UWS: CancelTransaction {transactionId}
        UWS->>Svc: reverse
        alt any item already delivered
            Svc-->>UWS: error 306 — settled by a human, never here
        else
            Svc->>Pay: reverse_provider_payment
            Svc-->>UWS: transactionState 2
        end
    end
